                    b: 'Correct — dividing by a small reference value blows up the percentage even when the real difference is trivial.',
                    c: 'Treadmill vs. overground affects values but is not the mechanism of index inflation.',
                    d: 'The reporting unit of cadence has nothing to do with SI inflation.',
