                    b: 'Correct — EMG records motor unit action potentials, the electrical signature of the nervous system commanding the muscle to contract, i.e. neural drive.',
                    c: 'Muscle length is a mechanical/kinematic quantity measured by other means (e.g. ultrasound or motion capture), not by EMG.',
                    d: 'Metabolic energy consumption is measured by calorimetry (oxygen uptake), a completely different method from EMG.',
