                      b: 'Footwear can affect gait modestly but is not the reason a slow walker\'s GRF peaks drop relative to a fast band; speed is.',
                      c: 'This is the classic error the lesson warns against — out-of-band is a flag to investigate, not an automatic pathology verdict.',
