                      b: 'This correctly names the later critics (Kuo, Gard) but the question asks who ORIGINALLY proposed the determinants — that is Saunders, Inman, and Eberhart; the critique came afterward.',
                      c: 'Perry contributed the phase framework and Gage the five prerequisites; neither authored the six determinants.',
