                      b: 'Correct — force-plate kinetics and dynamic EMG, cross-checked with kinematics, let clinicians distinguish causes (e.g. contracture vs. dynamic overactivity) that video alone cannot.',
                      c: 'Frame rate is a video parameter; high-speed cameras exist without any lab, so this is not the lab\'s defining advantage.',
