              judgeFraming: 'Judges probe crouch because it is the archetype of "the obvious deviation is not the primary cause" — the flexed stance knee is downstream of a failed ankle couple, tight hamstrings, or bony lever-arm distortion. A student who can point to the stance-phase knee curve AND reason back to which level actually drives it (and who knows that a naive Achilles lengthening can WORSEN it) demonstrates the primary-versus-secondary and lever-arm thinking that separates a real gait analyst from a pattern-labeler.',
