                      b: 'Perry actually pushed FOR instrumentation; observational analysis with her terms is only moderately reliable, not perfect.',
                      c: 'The gait cycle and its stride/step units are unchanged; Perry renamed the sub-phases functionally, she did not replace the cycle.',
