                      b: 'Correct — the Rheo Knee uses magnetorheological fluid, so an electromagnet sets viscosity/resistance directly, enabling fast, fine, motor-free changes.',
                      c: 'Neither knee is an energy-returning air spring; both are dampers, and the Rheo\'s distinction is its MR fluid.',
