              judgeFraming: 'Judges love the carbon-plate question because it separates students who parrot "it\'s a spring that returns energy" from those who know the actual mechanisms — reduced MTP-joint energy loss and a plate-plus-foam lever effect — and who know the ~4% figure is a population mean with real responder variability. A student who names Hoogkamer/Kram\'s Colorado work and the Calgary bending-stiffness lineage, and who reports individual variation, is demonstrating they engaged with the primary literature rather than the ad copy.',
