                      b: 'Inability to stand even with eyes open points to a broader balance failure, not the specific vision-dependence Romberg isolates.',
                      c: 'Roughly equal sway open vs. closed is a NEGATIVE (normal) Romberg — removing vision did not selectively worsen balance.',
