                      b: 'Correct — despite its popularity, meta-analytic evidence (Barry et al., 2014; Schoene et al., 2013) shows the TUG alone has only modest accuracy and should be combined with other risk information, not used as a lone cut-score.',
                      c: 'A stopwatch is exactly how the TUG is scored.',
