                      b: 'Correct — this graded verdict (variability + short-term Lyapunov best supported; Floquet/long-term Lyapunov construct-but-not-predictive; long-range correlations weak on construct) is the paper\'s core finding.',
                      c: 'The review found several measures DO have good validity for specific purposes; "none at all" is too extreme.',
                      d: 'The review did not crown the margin of stability as the sole valid measure; it graded a whole family of measures.',
