                      b: 'Correct — a proof mass is driven into vibration, and rotation induces a perpendicular Coriolis deflection proportional to the rotation rate, which is sensed capacitively.',
                      c: 'The Hall voltage is the mechanism of a magnetometer, not a gyroscope.',
