                      b: 'Correct — the step rhythm is only ~2 Hz, far below the 12.5 Hz Nyquist of a 25 Hz sampler, so step counting is well within range.',
                      c: '25 Hz gives ~40 ms sample spacing, so event timing is quantized to roughly ±20 ms, far coarser than 2 ms.',
