                      b: 'Bias and scale error are SENSOR amplitude errors, not the timeline-alignment errors between two clocks.',
                      c: 'Clipping and aliasing are amplitude/sampling artifacts, not clock-synchronization errors.',
                      d: 'Hard/soft-iron are magnetometer distortions, unrelated to clock synchronization.',
