                    prompt: 'Order the steps of one ZUPT-aided foot-mounted INS cycle across a single step.',
                    items: [
                      { id: 'i1', text: 'During swing, run strapdown double-integration (gravity-subtracted) to propagate velocity and position, letting error accumulate' },
                      { id: 'i2', text: 'Run the stance detector (e.g. accel magnitude near 1 g and gyro magnitude near zero) to find the flat-foot instant' },
                      { id: 'i3', text: 'At the detected stance, assert velocity = 0 as a measurement into the Kalman filter' },
                      { id: 'i4', text: 'The filter corrects the drifted velocity, and through the covariance the accumulated position and orientation errors, then continues to the next step' },
                    ],
                    correctOrder: ['i1', 'i2', 'i3', 'i4'],
