                      b: 'Accelerometers measure acceleration fine; the problem is error accumulation in the double integral, not the sensor sensing motion.',
                      c: 'The foot accelerates strongly during swing; the useful fact is that it momentarily STOPS at stance, not that it never accelerates.',
